      {
        "Id": "c6703cfe66944f298b1be721dc53aeac",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  Run A10 first so views have a Discipline and Sub-Discipline.  1 = ALL or e.g. LIGHTING, HVAC.  2 = name of the templates ({DISC} {SUB} {KIND} are replaced).  3 = detail level written in the template.  4 = in Lighting / Power / HVAC / Plumbing ... templates the other services categories are switched off.  5 = give every view of the group its template (views with another template are left alone).  6 RUN False = preview, True = make.  Ctrl+Z undoes.",
